ndue","name":"Cheesefondue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T12:11:43-08:00","id":800677,"title":"","content":"Let's just skip you using social characters for a death-battle tournament. Right off the bat, rank 1, no teamwork allowed, A Khan wins.<br /> <br /> Give some ranks and allow teamwork, Rokea win. They have a power that lets them turn someone's lungs into gills. You can't breath, you die. Simple. Ratkin are strong contenders, and I think I once calculated that with average rolls a Gaian garou can get over 90 soak dice for a short period of time (not sure if i calculated crinos into that, but a gift that doubles stamina+Troll skin, luna's armour and steel fur, as if garou would powergame like that),but I digress; you can't beat that, you just can't. I think there's a bastet power to rip hearts out from a distance, but it's level 5, and bastet work alone. Buggering up a person's lungs. It won't work on a vampire, but this is a Fera battle. I suppose if there was water then you could then jump into the water, but then the rokea can change your lungs back. And did you think you could beat Rokea in their home environment? Rokea win.<br /> <br /> Ok. I just saved you a lot of wasted effort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7244-innocent-flower","name":"Innocent Flower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7244_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T12:30:22-08:00","id":800682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Innocent Flower</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/800604-the-fera-fight?p=800677#post800677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's just skip you using social characters for a death-battle tournament. Right off the bat, rank 1, no teamwork allowed, A Khan wins.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have simple versions of each Fera, that I'll be running through once the main combats are finished.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4851-cheesefondue","name":"Cheesefondue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T14:27:09-08:00","id":800740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Innocent Flower</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/800604-the-fera-fight?p=800677#post800677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's just skip you using social characters for a death-battle tournament. Right off the bat, rank 1, no teamwork allowed, A Khan wins.<br /> <br /> Give some ranks and allow teamwork, Rokea win. They have a power that lets them turn someone's lungs into gills. You can't breath, you die. Simple. Ratkin are strong contenders, and I think I once calculated that with average rolls a Gaian garou can get over 90 soak dice for a short period of time (not sure if i calculated crinos into that, but a gift that doubles stamina+Troll skin, luna's armour and steel fur, as if garou would powergame like that),but I digress; you can't beat that, you just can't. I think there's a bastet power to rip hearts out from a distance, but it's level 5, and bastet work alone. Buggering up a person's lungs. It won't work on a vampire, but this is a Fera battle. I suppose if there was water then you could then jump into the water, but then the rokea can change your lungs back. And did you think you could beat Rokea in their home environment? Rokea win.<br /> <br /> Ok. I just saved you a lot of wasted effort.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let the man have his fun and actually do some empirical testing. Jeesh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}